     50  f003							; --- ABW rect tables + BombMaskBit (relocated 2026-10-10) ---
     51  f003							; The BMW span-overlap fix grew the walk ~9B and overflowed the
     52  f003							; pre-$FBF8 content end ($FBF5, only 2B slack → Origin
     53  f003							; Reverse-indexed). Tables are abs-indexed from BombMarkWalls only,
     54  f003							; so they park in the $F003 fill gap (kept clear of the stub's
     55  f003							; $F008 landing zone). Recheck this gap if the power-up stub grows.
