   1743  faa4							; UpdateLaserSound — low "zoom" tone on channel 0 while fire is held.
   1744  faa4							; Call order in bank0 overscan: UpdateBombSound, UpdateJetSound, this — so
   1745  faa4							; AUDV0 is already forced to 0 by UpdateBombSound when BombSnd = 0, which is
   1746  faa4							; exactly what silence-on-release needs (this routine then does nothing).
   1747  faa4							; Bomb events own ch0 (BombSnd > 0 -> skip) so blip/explosion stay audible.
   1748  faa4							; Pitch sweeps AUDF 4..14 on the free-running frame clock: AUDC=2 divides by
   1749  faa4							; 15, so f = 31400/((AUDF+1)*15) = 419..140 Hz (low). Triangle, 8 steps x
   1750  faa4							; 8 frames = 1.07 s per cycle, no audible wrap jump.
   1751  faa4							; Clobbers A/X; Y preserved. No ZP writes.
   1752  faa4				   UpdateLaserSound
